  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preserving folktales and folklore in the Himalayan region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed one-year long project aims to collect and preserve stories of dying small languages in the Himalayan regions of India and Bhutan to be finally collated into a book. The idea is to remember and record oral and folk histories of the region as part of preserving their identity.</narrative>
  </description>
